    "answer": {
      "short": "No, as $x$ is not a whole number.",
      "worked": "Use $y=3x+2$. Set $y=543$: $3x=543-2=541$, so $x=\\frac{541}{3}=180\\frac{1}{3}$.\n\nNo: the number of shapes must be a whole number.",
